{"id":"61420d2c00c6c288","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-refinement.md","title":"Refinement","display":"df-refinement — Refinement","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-refinement","aliases":["93-df-refinement"],"display":"df-refinement — Refinement","depends_on":["[[93-df-congruence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-refinement"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-refinement</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-refinement — Refinement"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"30b341bfbd8b5301\" href=\"?note=30b341bfbd8b5301\" title=\"93-df-congruence\">93-df-congruence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta,\\phi\">\\(\\theta,\\phi\\)</span> are relation candidates on an algebra candidate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A\">\\(\\mathbf A\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Refines}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Refines}_{93}\\)</span> (congruence-refinement predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}refinement}\\vdash \\mathrm{Refines}_{93}(\\theta,\\phi;\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\theta\\subseteq\\phi\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}refinement}\\vdash \\mathrm{Refines}_{93}(\\theta,\\phi;\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\theta\\subseteq\\phi\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A smaller equivalence relation gives a finer partition. The previous subalgebra/quotient condition did not define a recognized refinement relation and mixed congruences on different carriers.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"30b341bfbd8b5301","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\theta,\\phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Refines}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}refinement}\\vdash \\mathrm{Refines}_{93}(\\theta,\\phi;\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\theta\\subseteq\\phi","display":true}],"bytes":822,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["30b341bfbd8b5301"]}